1.) Butler Room (LOCKED Key at Room 8 Servant's Quarter) - Has Red Shiny candle. Bring the bell with you
- Reward: Can help solve any rooms, has a cooldown of 30 minutes (Bell returns to the Room #1)

2.) Scribe Room - Tells you about there are hidden passages that can be found to access hidden Rooms. An order that says "Please properly place the newly bought portraits" FOR ROOM 17 Portrait Gallery
- Reward: Nothing in particular. Trap Room filled with mimics

3.) The Library: Self Solvable - Rearrange the books by color, One of the colorless book when picked up will say Maid's Diary for Room 8. ONE OF THE BOOKS ALSO TELLS ABOUT SUMMONING SPIRITS IN THE OCCULT ROOM 19
- Reward: Key to Room 25

4.) Formal Lounge: Self Solvable - It is split to 4 equal parts and must be pieced together at the correct spot
- Reward: Unidentified Items. Hidden at the end of the GRAND CORRIDOR (27)

5.) Pantry: Self Solvable - Can enter at the opposite direction, or use Shinmyoumaru, (RECIPE BOOK can be found)
- Reward: Additional Ingredients to be cooked. Medicinal Ingredients

6.) Dining Room: Self solvable - You can listen to the conversation (Prompt players that people are having a discussion of their own)
First Convo: How long will it take before our food arrives?
Second Convo: Talk about trophy and then the portrait
Third Convo: Safe Room containing the key to the stairs
- Reward: Clue (Access to the Room 20 Projection Room a hidden door found in the bottom left of the Trophy Room 16 Behind the Bookshelves)

7.) Kitchen: Requires Recipe Book. Found at Room 5 (Pantry)
- Reward: FOOD ITEMS that can be used to serve people at the Dining Room or Grand Banquet Hall (Getting Pantry ingredients allows to serve people in the Grand Banquet Hall)

8.) Servant’s Quarters: Requires the second part of the diary. Found at Room 3 (Library), A CD of She is Legend is at one of the chests inside (Also item for kanako)
- Reward: Clue (Book says that the key to the head butler's Room 1 is at the Desk at the end of C2)

9.) Guest Room #1: Self Solvable - open the window, then move the cabinet blocking the light, turn the lights off inside the room.
- Reward: Unidentified Items. Hidden at the end of the C3, Clue: A lone mirror will show the way

10.) Guest Room #2: Self Solvable - move the bed
- Reward: unidentified Items. Hidden at the end of the C4

11.) Mari's Room (LOCKED Key at Room 18 Game Room): Requires to find She is Legend CD. Found at Room 8 (Servant's Quarters)
- Reward: Access to the Dressing Room

12.) Parlour Room: Clock has 2 digits, Requires 2 more from another broken clock, Open the vault inside (Requires 4 digits, 7354 CODE) (05:40) Missing: (07:30) Found at Room 15 the Master Bedroom
- Reward: Items

13.) Master's Office  (LOCKED): Self Solvable - False drawer (Can find a clue about the False Drawer in Room 12 Parlour Room)
- Reward: Access to the Projection Room, And a note about the Golden Statue that upgrades any weapon once

14.) Spa room: Self Solvable - Drain water in the tub (Clue about the valve found in Room 4 Formal Lounge). After the players takes a short rest here. A maid will come and tell them they can take a break in the Game room or in the Music Room directly after it (HIDDEN DOOR UNLOCKED FOR MUSIC ROOM 24)
- Reward:  Unidentified Item (Players can short rest here for 10 minutes only)

15.) Master Bedroom: Requires 3 premium candles. Found at Rooms 1, 5, 25, THERE IS a BROKEN CLOCK THAT 7:30 PM
- Reward: Key to one of the stairs (Left Side)

16.) Trophy Room: Self Solvable - Replace with any real weapon (Clue about the golden statue found in Room 13 Master's Office)
- Reward: The weapon is upgraded to +2 (Stone-statues comes to life)

17.) Portrait Gallery: Self Solvable - Rotate the portraits correctly (Clue about the portraits found at Secretarium Room 2)
- Reward: 2 Unidentified Item

18.) Game Room: Requires chess book guide or raw skills. Found at Room 11 Mari's Room. Mari is playing chess with the player. Will ask for a rematch with a simple toss coin (Will take back the item if she wins, else she gives another Unidentfied Item but better). Regardless of outcome Mari tells you how to Access Occult Room 19 HIDDEN ROOM ON BOTTOM RIGHT OF MASTER's OFFICE BEHIND A SMALL TABLE
- Reward: Unidentfied Item

19.) Occult Room: Requires a note about summoning spirits. Found at Room 3 (Library)
- Reward: 2 Unidentified Items + Battle. A STAIR TOWARDS THE NEXT FLOOR

20.) Projection Room: Self Solvable - Play the video in the correct order. (Clue about the video found at Room 25 Grand Banquet Hall) (Only 2 attempts before the projector runs out of energy) Failing will break the illusion and shows the DOOR to the Safe Room 21 but NO ITEMS
Correct Order: The Master Thanks the guests, Performance, Eating, Party
- Reward: Door to the Safe Room 21, 2 Unidentified Items

21.) Safe Room: Self Solvable - Must be tied to keep it stable. Requires an item that can be firmly stuck in the ground or extend its length. (Letting a person stay behind to pull it will cause a battle on both sides)
- Reward:  Key to one of the stairs (Right Side), Unidentified Items

22.) Dressing Room: Self Solvable - The mirror reflects a Path in one of the walls. But it must be moved around. (Clue found at Room 9 Guest Room 1)
- Reward: New access to Family History Room

23.) Family History Room: Requires Saphire Gemstone. Found at Room 17 Portrait Gallery
- Reward: VERY RARE UNIDENTFIED ITEM

24.) Music Room: Requires Music Sheet Found at Room 10 Guest Room 2
- Reward: VERY RARE UNIDENTFIED ITEM.  A STAIR TOWARDS THE NEXT FLOOR

25.) Grand Banquet Hall (LOCKED found at Room 3 LIBRARY): Requires 4 perception check. Each Perception check time moves forward (SEE PROJECTION ROOM)
- Reward: Item

